First-party plugin ports
========================

The modules in this crate are Rust ports of plugins from the Open RuneLite client
(references/open-runelite-rev-240, runelite-client). Each port keeps the BSD 2-Clause terms of
the source it was derived from, reproduced below. The copyright holders of every source file a
port draws on are listed per plugin.

Data files copied verbatim from the RuneLite resources keep their notice here as well:
data/roofremoval/overrides.jsonc (roofremoval/overrides.jsonc, Hydrox6).

